{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54255","headline":"牡丹 · 李山甫","name":"牡丹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"嫚黄妖紫间轻红，谷雨初晴早景中。\n静女不言还爱日，彩云无定只随风。\n炉烟坐觉沈檀薄，妆面行看粉黛空。\n此别又须经岁月，酒阑把烛遶芳丛。\n（见《梦梁录》卷十八）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李山甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54255.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54255","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}